      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "由她来指导的话，\n确实能做得比一般的训练员还要好。只是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "c84a04b36d857ff36aea42aa222b3ef1b5eb0edca6575a65f7c59276899829b5",
